      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should probably go but like i'm just not that worried. it isn't even bleeding much anymore. i just really need to get it closed up so i can keep moving around today. can i just use some hydrogen peroxide to kill the germs and then maybe some superglue or a thick ointment to seal the hole? that should work right?",
